  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「もちろんだぁ。これはもともと、おらの戦いだがら。最後の最後で逃げだしたら、格好悪ぃもん♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「それに、『まったくお手伝いできなかった』わけじゃねぇだよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「こうして、藤猪しゃんがテレビ局まできてくれただけで嬉しいんだぁ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-mizugi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mizugi_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「おらたち、ほとんど親しかったわけじゃねぇのに。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「いきなり呼びだしたのに、すぐ駆けつけてくれただろ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-mizugi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-mizugi_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 38,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「それだけで、おらは果報者だぁ。友達っていいな、ううん仲間って……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「感謝してるんだぁ、藤猪しゃん♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ことり",
    "text": "「あんがど。あとで必ず、お礼をするがらなぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 64,
    "dress": "old-mizugi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-mizugi_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
